    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle No. 4</strong> is an action-packed horde survival strategy game where you must fend off waves of enemies. Build your own combat vehicle by freely placing weapons and upgrading them with unique modules. Every decision matters: adapt your strategy, enhance your vehicle, and conquer increasingly tough challenges. Face the horde \u2013 with your ultimate, self-designed vehicle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Place your weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363890/extras/ea982ebe262e07b3d292539716baa6d0.poster.avif?t=1755085017\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363890/extras/ea982ebe262e07b3d292539716baa6d0.webm?t=1755085017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363890/extras/ea982ebe262e07b3d292539716baa6d0.mp4?t=1755085017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade every weapon separately\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363890/extras/ac99c38e4144d482c01a2b4c9b26e737.avif?t=1755085017\" width=1587 height=410 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new features as you play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363890/extras/4bbe0d733620a8336635c8a12fbcfa32.avif?t=1755085017\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>",
